9096 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Authoritative\054 not academic\050Write with confidence and expertise\056 Our copy demonstrates deep sector knowledge while remaining accessible and human\056\n\nClear\054 not clever\050Choose clarity over creativity\056 Use plain language\054 short sentences\054 and everyday words\056 If a simpler word exists\054 use it\056\n\nPrecise\054 not pedantic\050Every word should earn its place\056 Cut unnecessary words\056 Avoid abbreviations unless universally understood\056\n\nProfessional\054 not performative\050Be warm and approachable\054 but never forced\056 Avoid exclamation marks\054 ALL CAPS\054 quirky language\054 or anything that tries too hard\056\n\nCustomer\055focused\054 not company\055focused\050Write for the reader\054 not about ourselves\056 Ask\072 does this help our customer understand\054 decide\054 or act\077\n\nAccurate\054 always\050Proofread everything\056 Typos undermine trust\056 If you\047re unsure\054 check\056 Then check again\056\n\nJargon\055free in customer\055facing content\050Technical language is fine internally or with technical audiences\056 In customer\055facing copy\054 translate complexity into clarity\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 9097 0 R
     /Pg 7111 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

