9105 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Do\072\nWrite like you\047re explaining something to a smart colleague\nUse active voice \050\042We built this\042 not \042This was built by us\042\051\nFront\055load key information\nBreak complex ideas into digestible steps\nRead your work aloud\054 if you stumble\054 rewrite\n\nDon\047t\072\nUse corporate clich\351s \050\042leverage\054\042 \042synergy\054\042 \042best\055in\055class\042\051\nBury your point in long paragraphs\nAssume the reader knows what you know\nWrite to impress\054 write to inform\nLet a single typo slip through)
     /K [ 1 ]
